@hayes_border_state_outreach
title: Appeal to Border State Unionists
subtitle: Hayes reaches out to former <span style="color: #c4b369;">**Whigs**</span> and conditional <span style="color: #B22222;">**Unionists**</span> in Kentucky, Missouri, and Maryland.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; KY_middle_class_rep += 4; KY_rural_rep += 3; MO_middle_class_rep += 3; MO_rural_rep += 2; MD_middle_class_rep += 3; WV_rural_rep += 2;

Hayes, as a border state <span style="color: #c00000;">**Republican**</span> himself, understands the hesitation of former <span style="color: #c4b369;">**Whigs**</span> and conditional <span style="color: #B22222;">**Unionists**</span>. His war record and **<span style="color: #9D2933;">moderate</span>** approach appeal to those who want Union restored without social revolution. He travels the border states, speaking to merchants, lawyers, and farmers who fear both **<span style="color: #7A1F5C;">radical</span>** change and <span style="color: #0015bc;">**Democratic**</span> restoration. Support grows among those who see Hayes as a safe <span style="color: #c00000;">**Republican**</span> choice.

@hayes_library_committee
title: Use Library Committee Influence
subtitle: Hayes directs Library of Congress patronage and resources toward Republican cultural institutions.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1;
go-to: media

As Chairman of the Joint Committee on the Library of Congress, Hayes controls significant cultural patronage sich as library acquisitions, manuscript collections, and appointments. He directs funds toward <span style="color: #c00000;">**Republican**</span> newspapers' archives, supports loyal historians and scholars, and ensures that the narrative of the war and Reconstruction is told favorably. The Library becomes a tool of <span style="color: #c00000;">**Republican**</span> cultural influence. **<span style="color: #B5651D;">Conservatives</span>** grumble about intellectual waste while **<span style="color: #DAA520;">Liberals</span>** appreciate the support for learning.

@hayes_army_loyalty
title: Strengthen Army Officer Loyalty
subtitle: Hayes leverages his standing with Union officers to improve Army loyalty to <span style="color: #c00000;">**Republican**</span> government.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; army_loyalty += 0.1;

Hayes, still trusted by the officer corps from his wartime service, works quietly with key generals and colonels to ensure that the Army remains loyal to the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Republican**</span> government and committed to Reconstruction. His credibility with military menbuilt opens doors that other <span style="color: #c00000;">**Republican**</span> politicians cannot access. Officer loyalty strengthens.